  "post_content": "<p>La nit d&#39;aquest dilluns ha sigut el torn de la desfilada de disfresses dins de les festes d&#39;Artesa. Acompanyada per la colla de Dol&ccedil;ainers d&#39;Artesa, la comitiva ha donat diverses voltes per aquesta pedania d&#39;Onda.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/07/IMG_8887.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>En arribar novament a l&#39;escola, la Comissi&oacute; de Festes va donar a con&egrave;ixer que havia guanyat el concurs de disfresses la penya DKS, que anava d&#39;Avatar. Despr&eacute;s va haver discom&ograve;bil amb el DJ Josvi Spain.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesfestesartesa13/img_8840.jpg\" alt=\"img_8840\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesfestesartesa13/img_8841.jpg\" alt=\"img_8841\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesfestesartesa13/img_8842.jpg\" alt=\"img_8842\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesfestesartesa13/img_8843.jpg\" alt=\"img_8843\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesfestesartesa13/img_8844.jpg\" alt=\"img_8844\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesfestesartesa13/img_8845.jpg\" alt=\"img_8845\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesfestesartesa13/img_8847.jpg\" alt=\"img_8847\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesfestesartesa13/img_8848.jpg\" alt=\"img_8848\" style=\"max-width:100%;